  "description": "A zero-dependency spreadsheet and CSV reader and writer for .NET. Reads and writes .xlsx (OOXML) and CSV into a simple typed cell grid, no Interop, no ClosedXML, no OpenXML SDK.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "Talaan",
