  "projectUrl": "https://github.com/BaryoDev/Talaan",
  "published": "2026-10-13T09:20:39.263Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "0.3.0\nNew:\n- Spreadsheet.WriteXlsx(Stream, IEnumerable<SheetData>) writes every sheet to an .xlsx and leaves the stream open.\n- Spreadsheet.WriteFile(path, sheets) picks the format from the extension (.xlsx every sheet, .csv and .tsv the first sheet), writes a temp file and moves it into place.\n- CsvWriter.Write(Stream, SheetData, char delimiter) and CsvWriter.Write(Stream, IEnumerable<SheetData>) write RFC 4180 CSV or TSV as UTF-8 without a BOM.\n\nWriting rules:\n- Text is written as inline strings, so \"00123\" stays text. Numbers use invariant culture and round-trip. NaN and infinity throw.\n- Dates are serial numbers formatted yyyy-mm-dd, or yyyy-mm-dd hh:mm:ss when they have a time, and read back as dates. Dates before 1900-03-01 throw.\n- Invalid sheet names, an empty sheet list and cell text over 32767 characters throw ArgumentException, and nothing is written.\n- Characters XML 1.0 forbids are dropped from text and sheet names.\n- No styling, formulas, column widths or merged cells.",
